# 固定文本换行，确保两端检出后的上游文件哈希一致。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.glb -text
*.bin -text
*.otf -text
*.ttf -text
*.png -text
*.ico -text
*.pdf -text

# Preserve the verified Windows patch output byte-for-byte in the standalone
# source import. Some generated sources already contain CRLF; do not rewrite
# them on add or checkout. Git still detects and displays textual diffs.
* -text
